{"hymn":"S560","parent":"E730","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Soy presionado hasta extenuación","subtitle":"Consuelo en las pruebas—Al obtener ganacia de los sufrimientos","syl":{"n1":"Soy","n2":["pre","i"],"n3":["sio","m"],"n4":["na","m"],"n5":["do","t"],"n6":["has","i"],"n7":["ta‿ex","m"],"n8":["te","m"],"n9":["nua","m"],"n11":["ción;","t"],"n12":"Más","n13":"que","n14":"mis","n15":["fuer","i"],"n16":["zas,","t"],"n17":"más","n18":"que","n19":"mi","n20":["vi","i"],"n21":["gor;","t"],"n22":"En","n23":["cuer","i"],"n24":["po","t"],"n25":["y‿al","i"],"n26":["ma,","t"],"n27":["gran","i"],"n28":["de‿es","t"],"n29":"la","n30":["pre","i"],"n31":["sión,","t"],"n33":["Has","i"],"n34":["ta‿en","t"],"n35":"la","n36":["men","i"],"n37":["te","t"],"n38":["sur","i"],"n39":["gen","t"],"n40":["nu","i"],"n41":["bes","t"],"n42":"hoy.","n43":"Dios,","n44":["mi‿es","i"],"n45":["pe","m"],"n46":["ran","m"],"n47":["za","t"],"n48":"y","n49":["go","i"],"n50":["zo","t"],"n51":"fiel;","n52":"Mi","n53":["vi","i"],"n54":["da","t"],"n55":"de","n56":["re","i"],"n57":["su","m"],"n58":["rrec","m"],"n59":["ci","m"],"n60":["ón","t"],"n61":"es","n62":"Él."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Por mis contrarios presionado soy;","También de amigos tengo opresión;","Soy presionado a sólo en Dios confiar,","Hasta Su vara y cayado amar."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Soy presionado hasta libre ser,","Hasta, en lo más difícil, fe tener,","Hasta entrar en la vida eternal,","Y esa vida poder derramar."]}]}